--- !u!114 &448953065846236776
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 7708181362478917356}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6d8e833468e94ca478236b641bd7870f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  firstTimeDialogue:
    dialogueLines:
    - character:
        name: ???
        icon: {fileID: 8483871856083018034, guid: 9e8fb8f9771a99e4c8494ad55fa73574, type: 3}
      line: "Well, this is a surprise. Didn\u2019t think I\u2019d see another face
        down here."
    - character:
        name: Yanluo
        icon: {fileID: 3804419739914296938, guid: 16279261e127e3b45b1e22ce2e0d4d2d, type: 3}
      line: Who are you?
    - character:
        name: Sherma
        icon: {fileID: 8483871856083018034, guid: 9e8fb8f9771a99e4c8494ad55fa73574, type: 3}
      line: "Sherma. I\u2019ve been here a long time."
    - character:
        name: Yanluo
        icon: {fileID: 3804419739914296938, guid: 16279261e127e3b45b1e22ce2e0d4d2d, type: 3}
      line: "I didn\u2019t think there\u2019d be anyone here at all. I thought Hell
        would be empty."
    - character:
        name: Sherma
        icon: {fileID: 8483871856083018034, guid: 9e8fb8f9771a99e4c8494ad55fa73574, type: 3}
      line: "Empty? That\u2019s exactly how it fools you."
    - character:
        name: Yanluo
        icon: {fileID: 3804419739914296938, guid: 16279261e127e3b45b1e22ce2e0d4d2d, type: 3}
      line: Then what is this place?
    - character:
        name: Sherma
        icon: {fileID: 8483871856083018034, guid: 9e8fb8f9771a99e4c8494ad55fa73574, type: 3}
      line: Some call it a prison, others call it a trial. Either way, it stands
        between you and the surface.
    - character:
        name: Yanluo
        icon: {fileID: 3804419739914296938, guid: 16279261e127e3b45b1e22ce2e0d4d2d, type: 3}
      line: Surface... so there is a way out.
    - character:
        name: Sherma
        icon: {fileID: 8483871856083018034, guid: 9e8fb8f9771a99e4c8494ad55fa73574, type: 3}
      line: "There is. But Hell doesn\u2019t let anyone walk out for free."
    - character:
        name: Yanluo
        icon: {fileID: 3804419739914296938, guid: 16279261e127e3b45b1e22ce2e0d4d2d, type: 3}
      line: Then tell me what I need to do.
    - character:
        name: Sherma
        icon: {fileID: 8483871856083018034, guid: 9e8fb8f9771a99e4c8494ad55fa73574, type: 3}
      line: Fight your way through each chamber. Kill every enemy in the room. Only
        then will the exit open.
    - character:
        name: Yanluo
        icon: {fileID: 3804419739914296938, guid: 16279261e127e3b45b1e22ce2e0d4d2d, type: 3}
      line: I have to ask... why me?
    - character:
        name: Sherma
        icon: {fileID: 8483871856083018034, guid: 9e8fb8f9771a99e4c8494ad55fa73574, type: 3}
      line: Because you were chosen to endure it.
    - character:
        name: Yanluo
        icon: {fileID: 3804419739914296938, guid: 16279261e127e3b45b1e22ce2e0d4d2d, type: 3}
      line: Great.
    - character:
        name: Sherma
        icon: {fileID: 8483871856083018034, guid: 9e8fb8f9771a99e4c8494ad55fa73574, type: 3}
      line: "You\u2019ll also notice something strange. Hell reacts to you."
    - character:
        name: Yanluo
        icon: {fileID: 3804419739914296938, guid: 16279261e127e3b45b1e22ce2e0d4d2d, type: 3}
      line: "Uhuh.. and what\u2019s that supposed to mean?"
    - character:
        name: Sherma
        icon: {fileID: 8483871856083018034, guid: 9e8fb8f9771a99e4c8494ad55fa73574, type: 3}
      line: "There\u2019s power in you, the kind this place recognizes."
    - character:
        name: Yanluo
        icon: {fileID: 3804419739914296938, guid: 16279261e127e3b45b1e22ce2e0d4d2d, type: 3}
      line: "I don\u2019t know what you\u2019re talking about."
    - character:
        name: Sherma
        icon: {fileID: 8483871856083018034, guid: 9e8fb8f9771a99e4c8494ad55fa73574, type: 3}
      line: "You will soon enough. After some chambers, Hell will offer you power.
        Take it, and you\u2019ll survive longer."
    - character:
        name: Yanluo
        icon: {fileID: 3804419739914296938, guid: 16279261e127e3b45b1e22ce2e0d4d2d, type: 3}
      line: It just gives it to me?
    - character:
        name: Sherma
        icon: {fileID: 8483871856083018034, guid: 9e8fb8f9771a99e4c8494ad55fa73574, type: 3}
      line: Not out of kindness. Think of it as a test... or bait.
    - character:
        name: Yanluo
        icon: {fileID: 3804419739914296938, guid: 16279261e127e3b45b1e22ce2e0d4d2d, type: 3}
      line: So I have to choose.
    - character:
        name: Sherma
        icon: {fileID: 8483871856083018034, guid: 9e8fb8f9771a99e4c8494ad55fa73574, type: 3}
      line: Exactly. Choose well. The right choice makes the difference.
    - character:
        name: Yanluo
        icon: {fileID: 3804419739914296938, guid: 16279261e127e3b45b1e22ce2e0d4d2d, type: 3}
      line: "And what if I don\u2019t make it through a chamber?"
    - character:
        name: Sherma
        icon: {fileID: 8483871856083018034, guid: 9e8fb8f9771a99e4c8494ad55fa73574, type: 3}
      line: Then you'll join everyone else this place has already taken.
    - character:
        name: Yanluo
        icon: {fileID: 3804419739914296938, guid: 16279261e127e3b45b1e22ce2e0d4d2d, type: 3}
      line: "I\u2019m not staying here. Whoever sent me down here is going to regret
        it."
    - character:
        name: Sherma
        icon: {fileID: 8483871856083018034, guid: 9e8fb8f9771a99e4c8494ad55fa73574, type: 3}
      line: Then stay alive long enough to reach them. This realm is full of things
        made to keep you here.
    - character:
        name: Yanluo
        icon: {fileID: 3804419739914296938, guid: 16279261e127e3b45b1e22ce2e0d4d2d, type: 3}
      line: But you think I can do it.
    - character:
        name: Sherma
        icon: {fileID: 8483871856083018034, guid: 9e8fb8f9771a99e4c8494ad55fa73574, type: 3}
      line: I think Hell is interested in you. That usually means something.
    - character:
        name: Yanluo
        icon: {fileID: 3804419739914296938, guid: 16279261e127e3b45b1e22ce2e0d4d2d, type: 3}
      line: "...I\u2019ll take my chances."
    - character:
        name: Sherma
        icon: {fileID: 8483871856083018034, guid: 9e8fb8f9771a99e4c8494ad55fa73574, type: 3}
      line: "One more thing. You\u2019ll find gems as you go."
    - character:
        name: Yanluo
        icon: {fileID: 3804419739914296938, guid: 16279261e127e3b45b1e22ce2e0d4d2d, type: 3}
      line: Gems?
    - character:
        name: Sherma
        icon: {fileID: 8483871856083018034, guid: 9e8fb8f9771a99e4c8494ad55fa73574, type: 3}
      line: "Left behind by the dead. Bring them to me when you find me again, and
        I\u2019ll make them worth your while."
    - character:
        name: Yanluo
        icon: {fileID: 3804419739914296938, guid: 16279261e127e3b45b1e22ce2e0d4d2d, type: 3}
      line: "So you\u2019re a merchant too?"
    - character:
        name: Sherma
        icon: {fileID: 8483871856083018034, guid: 9e8fb8f9771a99e4c8494ad55fa73574, type: 3}
      line: ...
    - character:
        name: Sherma
        icon: {fileID: 8483871856083018034, guid: 9e8fb8f9771a99e4c8494ad55fa73574, type: 3}
      line: Call me useful.
  repeat: "Hell has rewarded you\u2026 Will you claim what it offers through me?"
  noLine: Then go. The chambers will test you further.
  interactPrompt: {fileID: 2470671640675287491}
